      "message": "Can we delete the while loop only check for `ro.boot.hardware.gltransport`?  Reason:\n\nEmulator seems to already define `ro.boot.hardware.gltransport`\n\nhttps://source.corp.google.com/h/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:hardware/google/aemu/host-common/include/host-common/hw-config-defs.h;l\u003d291?q\u003dhw_gltransport\n\nSo while it\u0027s important to worry about older guests + newer host, newer guest + older host is a less tested config.  \n\nWe can also then assume the transport is non-empty\n\nSo I think you may do something like:\n\n```\n#if defined(__Fuchsia__) || defined(LINUX_GUEST_BUILD)\n   return HOST_CONNECTION_VIRTIO_GPU_ADDRESS_SPACE.\nelse\n   // Get prop\n   // Do comparison.\n#endif\n```",
